<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Diamond Offshore upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Diamond Offshore upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Diamond Offshore Drilling Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 62-1/2.</p>
</text>
